<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net sellers of Japanese stocks in week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net sellers of Japanese stocks in week.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of Japanese stocks on the Tokyo, Osaka and Nagoya stock exchanges in the week of August 26 to August 30, exchange data showed.</p>
<p>The figures, which are rounded, are as follows:</p>
<p>    Total foreign buying	   312.38 billion yen</p>
<p>    Total foreign selling	  320.69 billion yen</p>
<p>    Net selling			  8.30 billion yen</p>
<p>    Previous week net selling     38.53 billion yen</p>
</text>
